  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "量子科學與技術",
    "sub_ename": "QUANTUM SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在帶領學生深入認識量子電腦科技的核心概念與前沿發展。課程以「主題式專家講授」為設計特色，邀請國內知名量子計算與量子科技領域的學者，以其專長領域授課，每位專家講授至少三週，使學生能系統性地理解不同量子技術議題。內容涵蓋量子計算基本原理、量子演算法、量子通訊、原子系統、雲端量子應用、量子硬體架構等多面向主題。透過多位專家分享最新研究成果與實務經驗，學生將能掌握量子科技的跨領域知識框架，並建立面對新興量子時代所需的理解能力與思辨能力。課程適合已具備量子計算基礎者進一步深化與拓展視野。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to guide students toward a deeper understanding of the core concepts and cutting-edge developments in quantum computer technology. A key feature of the course is its “topic-based expert lecture” design, in which renowned domestic scholars in quantum computing and quantum technology are invited to teach topics aligned with their specialties. Each expert offers at least three weeks of instruction, enabling students to systematically explore various issues in quantum technologies. The course covers a wide range of themes, including the fundamentals of quantum computation, quantum algorithms, quantum communication, atomic systems, cloud-based quantum applications, and quantum hardware architectures. Through the sharing of the latest research findings and practical insights by multiple experts, students will develop an interdisciplinary understanding of quantum technologies and cultivate the analytical abilities needed for the emerging quantum era. This course is suited for students who already possess foundational knowledge of quantum computing and wish to deepen and broaden their perspectives.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "理解量子科學核心原理",
      "describe_en": "Understand the core principles of quantum science."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "掌握量子計算與量子演算法基礎",
      "describe_en": "Grasp the fundamentals of quantum computing and quantum algorithms."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "連結前沿 quantum technology 發展與產業應用",
      "describe_en": "Connect cutting-edge quantum technology developments with industry applications."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "培養跨領域整合與問題分析能力",
      "describe_en": "Cultivate interdisciplinary integration and problem-analysis skills."
    }
  ],
